WEBVTT

00:06:27.842 --> 00:06:31.220
And it was surrounded
by a two-story high security wall

00:06:31.262 --> 00:06:33.848
with snipers all the way along the top.

00:06:33.848 --> 00:06:36.058
As I get out of the limo,

00:06:36.058 --> 00:06:39.270
I'm escorted into
the building at gunpoint.

00:06:40.229 --> 00:06:41.814
I'm led into a room.

00:06:42.857 --> 00:06:45.776
I waited, and he comes in
with a giant entourage.

00:06:45.818 --> 00:06:47.820
And I said, "Mr. President,

00:06:47.862 --> 00:06:51.240
before I capture this moment
of history on film,

00:06:51.282 --> 00:06:53.325
I've got a question I'd like to ask you."

00:06:53.951 --> 00:06:56.704
I said, "I was brought up
by my mom and dad

00:06:56.745 --> 00:06:59.373
listening to the music of The Beatles.